1a66077bdb4e34229891dfd", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-2ec78183bedf3dbfc94e1603", "original_sha256": "b2b735fcc11e8aa191de045e20fc1334299d6b80bf52b14065d2a75a0afb65e8", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-d8940a0ea5f74003bc415bb0", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/52a369f48086472c97e211c40449e2cab5274f7d1234b89668be687f38afb5c0.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "52a369f48086472c97e211c40449e2cab5274f7d1234b89668be687f38afb5c0", "user_turn_count": 2, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 234], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "ec8e9d93d4818205f7862a28ccab7e71e57c0a282f215e008645af3cfe7900f5", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 428], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "79975ef168e8e46dfcb79a0802fb9b9af6756f0def5f937c0cea0a721a1d3eef", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这是这道题目和两个不同的解法。\n\n我能想到的思路是：\n\n1. 首先要知道平行四边形的面积公式。在已知两条邻边具体长度的情况下，要怎么求出平行四边形的面积？\n2. 然后把 α + 2β 和 α + β 这两个向量的具体长度算出来。\n3. 算出来之后，结合这两个长度和平行四边形的面积公式，把这道题的答案做出来。\n\n但我现在卡住了：我忘记了已知两条邻边时该怎么求平行四边形的面积，同时也不知道怎么求这两个具体向量的长度。还是说我这个思路一开始就有问题，不应该往这个方向走？"}